{"id":"73b50f4361a5eced","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation.md","title":"ZFC Setop Range Of Relation","display":"df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation — ZFC Setop Range Of Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation — ZFC Setop Range Of Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setop-range-of-relation — ZFC Setop Range Of Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,Y\\in V\">\\(R,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}range\\text{-}of\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S(Y,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land Y=\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}range\\text{-}of\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S(Y,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land Y=\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The comprehension is bounded by a codomain witnessing that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a binary relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}range\\text{-}of\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSetopRangeOfRelation}_S(Y,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists A,B\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land Y=\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":854,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3478","locations":["正文"]